-## 7. STREAM 콜백 API
-
-`socket_t` STREAM 헬퍼:
-- `stream_attach(zlink_stream_on_packets_fn, int flags)`
-- `stream_attach(zlink_stream_on_packets_fn, stream_dispatch_mode mode)`
-- `stream_detach()`
-- `stream_send(...)`
-
-모드 규칙:
