+| `monitor_handle_t` | `zlink_socket_monitor_*`, `zlink_monitor_snapshot` | socket monitor |
+| `service_monitor_handle_t` | `zlink_service_monitor_*`, `zlink_monitor_snapshot` | discovery/spot monitor |
