-## 5. Build
+## 5. Service Layer Summary
+
+The service wrappers are intentionally limited to:
+
+- `registry_t`
+- `registry_query_client_t`
+- `discovery_t`
+- `spot_node_t`
+- `spot_t`
+
+This binding no longer documents legacy `receiver_t`, `spot_pub_t`,
